kVK059dpgwoQ7kNvwHj_SoW&_nc_oc=AdovxG0MpekF316Xy_y0_IVL-x-QkQaAVAGR6wlDZPS2Ztdr29_ZIx3kTtz9J4QT_aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz5P-VFLemZmzjKG_MH1G-DiYGv1tNonoQYLSOUd3ovQw&oe=69C29C37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gC3SxmI84h8Q7kNvwGnu71V&_nc_oc=AdqOzRZtfjl7VfevYbV6c9No-FBra7gQ0dnuRueNoPdCylRckgnxR0KWianoqzfNGT4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxsf85SmHKMO5faH3_guIjTNd-5nTuPETeNrpk3xuTtng&oe=69C29DCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NIM0kxd_x-8Q7kNvwFiW1Ng&_nc_oc=AdoVtR8inb_2bxiVss-_yABZJOabuMlNDsqrJ-fhreF8jowfiazU7FesIpOksmVCYc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfzaA5axtFDeFyK-OVDQq5tpBIewvBa2g_jDktnklMOXaw&oe=69C28AEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xlIfWxrxsoMQ7kNvwEp52Uk&_nc_oc=Ado7ry0ZnyMqlseeUJChgl5T7td4gLqvx3xZhIOpqHAZqEQsq3rE71ovYnmsBDmJfm8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwZsrDNVjdSg9hz-iFJBNT0ZpIPsWluAScWtmVA-kcmvQ&oe=69C27443"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-XSHyb7Rt8QQ7kNvwGJ13uy&_nc_oc=AdqNEVa2fmy0ci997Rnle4yxP4YSWr82GkZ2dWIhi9IGqjg8HGScguF80xJsdb5nzd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afyu4ul9rXMna8DRo7a1l0S_Qq_L3PJe8LGnI6ILDCZ2-w&oe=69C26C98"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mVHbaj7jTnIQ7kNvwHVRGoz&_nc_oc=Adp1JXVeA4BGZRgdI5Y-Y0pA_dG09CVs3pF_jKqy2cV9lomH9kin3rqLCFcxQExnlDM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afxc--fLdJPnHjYBEl2CSbcY4pUKyERduI3FsGIxYuuPyA&oe=69C27FBC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080